  <para style="q1"><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6"/><note style="x" caller="-"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Jen 19.24</char></note>God i panisimgud ol man blong mi,
</para>
